cess to the book—this includes anyone who joins the account later. This setting is ideal for something like a company handbook that you want everyone on your team to instantly have access to. You can give writer access to individuals even when everyone is on.\n"], ["updated_at", "2026-08-10 13:43:22.848791"], ["id", 936075702]]
