/bin/bash -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL http://once.test/install/5555-5555-5555-5555)&quot;IMPORTANT NOTE: Do not give this install command out to anyone, or share it on the public internet. It is personalized to you, and the license is tied back to you. Your personalized purchase token can be found in the email you received after you downloaded Writebook

